{"id":"gpb844crdnjs4vx57x8ojathn","title":"灰度报告：比特币波动率已落入美国大盘股区间","originalTitle":"灰度：比特币波动率已落入美国大盘股区间，少量配置可改善组合效率","summary":"灰度报告指出比特币波动率已落入美国大盘股区间（43% vs 标普500中19%成分股波动率）。研究显示比特币过去三年年化回报60%，剔除最佳/最差10天分别降至7%和197%。报告认为传统市场因子对比特币回报解释力有限，建议少量配置以改善组合效率。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2306166"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T01:20:55.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T01:34:29.339Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T01:34:29.339Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["研究报告","比特币"],"score":54,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e225bf79-8a2f-47a6-ab48-5adebb00d3ee","title":"灰度报告：比特币波动率降至美股大盘股区间，建议少量配置"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e225bf79-8a2f-47a6-ab48-5adebb00d3ee","title":"灰度报告：比特币波动率降至美股大盘股区间，建议少量配置"}],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fHAnehQ4HUgs","reportCount":3,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}